{"3068230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mad Metal", "steam_appid": 3068230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b50bc9bbdf180459e9d3fe59fcc8ce14.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b50bc9bbdf180459e9d3fe59fcc8ce14.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b50bc9bbdf180459e9d3fe59fcc8ce14.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't walk into the apocalypse. <strong>You drive through it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >America, 2080s. AI corporations created sentient machines that made decisions no human authorized. Now they roam the wastelands, not to kill, but to convert. Humans are abducted and used to birth a new half-human, half-machine race created to inherit what's left of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took your wife. They have your daughter. You're one of the few still human. Still fighting. Still behind the wheel. And they haven’t taken you yet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead Aim Targeting System </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/73b183607358d4cbb8c15e617910f036.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/73b183607358d4cbb8c15e617910f036.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/73b183607358d4cbb8c15e617910f036.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow time and dismember vital components. Break doors to target the driver, puncture fuel tanks to trigger explosions, or rip wheels apart to stop a vehicle dead in its tracks. Every enemy has a weak point. Find it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign, Co-op, Extraction, and PvP </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b1fa0ff0cde6b95b86c4b1423f463e42.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b1fa0ff0cde6b95b86c4b1423f463e42.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b1fa0ff0cde6b95b86c4b1423f463e42.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the campaign solo, squad up in open-world co-op, survive long enough to extract with your team, or go head-to-head in ranked and unranked 1v1 deathmatches. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built, Not Bought </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/0cc76b1a3690ed6f30f8b5f54a93f208.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/0cc76b1a3690ed6f30f8b5f54a93f208.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/0cc76b1a3690ed6f30f8b5f54a93f208.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part has a cost in weight and aerodynamics. Build for speed, build for firepower, but build smart. Pick up powerful augments mid-run to enhance your weapons and vehicle on the fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cabin-View Combat </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your dash instruments in first-person. Primary weapon overheated? Secondary out of ammo? Draw your sidearm and finish the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Encounters </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive threats that push your build to its limit. Learn their weak points or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Abilities </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine active and passive abilities with your loadout to unlock new playstyles. Use sonar to track enemies through walls, drop caltrops to disable vehicles, or hit the jetpack and take the high ground.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't walk into the apocalypse. <strong>You drive through it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >America, 2080s. AI corporations created sentient machines that made decisions no human authorized. Now they roam the wastelands, not to kill, but to convert. Humans are abducted and used to birth a new half-human, half-machine race created to inherit what's left of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took your wife. They have your daughter. You're one of the few still human. Still fighting. Still behind the wheel. And they haven’t taken you yet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead Aim Targeting System </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/73b183607358d4cbb8c15e617910f036.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/73b183607358d4cbb8c15e617910f036.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extra