ild for speed, build for firepower, but build smart. Pick up powerful augments mid-run to enhance your weapons and vehicle on the fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cabin-View Combat </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/1d631e9be012e7d5454e8c3c1126f1f1.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your dash instruments in first-person. Primary weapon overheated? Secondary out of ammo? Draw your sidearm and finish the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Encounters </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b026b7dcb4d0a51df602aceffdcbe9a3.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive threats that push your build to its limit. Learn their weak points or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Abilities </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.poster.avif?t=1788283196\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.webm?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ccdfebd36e411404f9af09008b4a7cc0.mp4?t=1788283196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine active and passive abilities with your loadout to unlock new playstyles. Use sonar to track enemies through walls, drop caltrops to disable vehicles, or hit the jetpack and take the high ground.</p>", "short_description": "A dark vehicle combat shooter where you manipulate time, customize your vehicle, and dismember the opposition as you survive in an AI-driven apocalypse. Fight solo or with a friend in open-world co-op, extraction, and deathmatches.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/0a55b62487b00cf8e499f76bdac36d54df9528a1/header.jpg?t=1788283196", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/14e6bf539e5f532148c4c86ac04348041e19217b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788283196", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/14e6bf539e5f532148c4c86ac04348041e19217b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788283196", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3-6100 / Core™ i5-2500K or AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><